    "directions": [
      "Heat oil in a pan. Add in mustard seeds and let them splutter.",
      "Now add in green chillies, fennel seeds and curry leaves. Saute for a minute.",
      "Then add in peanuts and sautÃ© for 2-3 minutes or until they turn golden brown in colour.",
      "Now add in raisins, roasted chana dal. Give it a nice mix.",
      "Add in turmeric powder and red chilli powder. Give it a nice mix and let the powdered masalas cook for a minute.",
      "Now add in the cornflakes and give it a nice toss.",
      "Now add chaat masala, sugar and salt. Give it a nice toss.",
      "Turn off the flame and let it cool down to room temperature.",
      "Store in airtight jars."
    ],
